{
  "snp3.12:0.1": "",
  "snp3.12:0.2": "",
  "snp3.12:1.1": "Evam me sutaṃ: ",
  "snp3.12:1.2": "Ekaṃ samayaṃ Bhagavā Sāvatthiyaṃ viharati Pubbārāme Migāramātu pāsāde. ",
  "snp3.12:1.3": "Tena kho pana samayena Bhagavā tadahuposathe pannarase puṇṇāya puṇṇamāya rattiyā bhikkhusaṃghaparivuto abbhokāse nisinno hoti. ",
  "snp3.12:1.4": "Atha kho Bhagavā tuṇhībhūtaṃ tuṇhībhūtaṃ bhikkhusaṃghaṃ anuviloketvā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "snp3.12:2.1": "\"‘ye te bhikkhave kusalā dhammā ariyā niyyānikā sambodhagāmino, tesaṃ vo bhikkhave kusalānaṃ dhammānaṃ ariyānaṃ niyyānikānaṃ sambodhagāmīnaṃ kā upanisā savanāyā' ti, iti ce bhikkhave pucchitāro assu, te evam assu vacanīyā: ",
  "snp3.12:2.2": "‘yāvad eva dvayatānaṃ dhammānaṃ yathābhūtaṃ ñāṇāyā' ti. ",
  "snp3.12:2.3": "Kiñ ca dvayataṃ vadetha: ",
  "snp3.12:3.1": "‘idaṃ dukkhaṃ, ayaṃ dukkhasamudayo' ti ayam ekānupassanā, ",
  "snp3.12:3.2": "‘ayaṃ dukkhanirodho, ayaṃ dukkhanirodhagāminī paṭipadā' ti ayaṃ dutiyānupassanā. ",
  "snp3.12:3.3": "Evaṃ sammā-dvayatānupassino kho bhikkhave bhikkhuno appamattassa ātāpino pahitattassa viharato dvinnaṃ phalānaṃ aññataraṃ phalaṃ pāṭikaṃkhaṃ: ",
  "snp3.12:3.4": "diṭṭhe va dhamme aññā, sati vā upādisese anāgāmitā\" ti. ",
  "snp3.12:4.1": "Idam avoca Bhagavā, ",
  "snp3.12:4.2": "idaṃ vatvā Sugato athāparaṃ etad avoca Satthā: 724. ",
  "snp3.12:5.1": "\"Ye dukkhaṃ na-ppajānanti ",
  "snp3.12:5.2": "atho dukkhassa sambhavaṃ, ",
  "snp3.12:5.3": "yattha ca sabbaso dukkhaṃ ",
  "snp3.12:5.4": "asesaṃ uparujjhati, ",
  "snp3.12:5.5": "tañ ca maggaṃ na jānanti ",
  "snp3.12:5.6": "dukkhūpasamagāminaṃ, 725. ",
  "snp3.12:6.1": "cetovimuttihīnā te ",
  "snp3.12:6.2": "atho paññāvimuttiyā, ",
  "snp3.12:6.3": "abhabbā te antakiriyāya, ",
  "snp3.12:6.4": "te ve jātijarūpagā. 726. ",
  "snp3.12:7.1": "Ye ca dukkhaṃ pajānanti ",
  "snp3.12:7.2": "atho dukkhassa sambhavaṃ, ",
  "snp3.12:7.3": "yattha ca sabbaso dukkhaṃ ",
  "snp3.12:7.4": "asesaṃ uparujjhati,| ",
  "snp3.12:7.5": "tañ ca maggaṃ pajānanti ",
  "snp3.12:7.6": "dukkhūpasamagāminaṃ, 727. ",
  "snp3.12:8.1": "cetovimuttisampannā ",
  "snp3.12:8.2": "atho paññāvimuttiyā ",
  "snp3.12:8.3": "bhabbā te antakiriyāya, ",
  "snp3.12:8.4": "na te jātijarūpagā\" ti. ",
  "snp3.12:9.1": "\"‘Siyā aññena pi pariyāyena sammā-dvayatānupassanā' ti, iti ce bhikkhave pucchitāro assu, ",
  "snp3.12:9.2": "‘siyā' ti 'ssu vacanīyā, ",
  "snp3.12:9.3": "kathañ ca siyā: ",
  "snp3.12:9.4": "‘yaṃ kiñci dukkhaṃ sambhoti, sabbaṃ upadhipaccayā' ti ayam ekānupassanā, ",
  "snp3.12:9.5": "‘upadhīnan tv-eva asesavirāganirodhā n' atthi dukkhassa sambhavo' ti ayaṃ dutiyānupassanā. ",
  "snp3.12:9.6": "Evaṃ sammā\" --pe-- ",
  "snp3.12:9.7": "athāparaṃ etad avoca Satthā: 728. ",
  "snp3.12:10.1": "\"Upadhīnidānā pabhavanti dukkhā ",
  "snp3.12:10.2": "ye keci lokasmiṃ anekarūpā, ",
  "snp3.12:10.3": "yo ve avidvā upadhiṃ karoti, ",
  "snp3.12:10.4": "punappunaṃ dukkham upeti mando, -- ",
  "snp3.12:10.5": "tasmā pajānaṃ upadhiṃ na kayirā ",
  "snp3.12:10.6": "dukkhassa jātippabhavānupassī\" ti. ",
  "snp3.12:11.1": "\"‘Siyā aññena pi pariyāyena sammā-dvayatānupassanā' ti, iti ce bhikkhave pucchitāro assu, ",
  "snp3.12:11.2": "‘siyā' ti 'ssu vacanīyā, ",
  "snp3.12:11.3": "kathañ ca siyā: ",
  "snp3.12:11.4": "‘yaṃ kiñci dukkhaṃ sambhoti, sabbaṃ avijjāpaccayā' ti ayam ekānupassanā, ",
  "snp3.12:11.5": "‘avijjāya tv-eva asesavirāganirodhā n' atthi dukkhassa sambhavo' ti ayaṃ dutiyānupassanā. ",
  "snp3.12:11.6": "Evaṃ sammā\" . . . ",
  "snp3.12:11.7": "athaparaṃ etad avoca Satthā: 729. ",
  "snp3.12:12.1": "\"Jātimaraṇasaṃsāraṃ ",
  "snp3.12:12.2": "*ye vajanti* punappunaṃ ",
  "snp3.12:12.3": "itthabhāvaññathābhāvaṃ, ",
  "snp3.12:12.4": "avijjāy' eva sā gati. 730. ",
  "snp3.12:13.1": "Avijjā h' ayaṃ mahāmoho, ",
  "snp3.12:13.2": "yen' idaṃ saṃsitaṃ ciraṃ, ",
  "snp3.12:13.3": "vijjāgatā ca ye sattā, ",
  "snp3.12:13.4": "nāgacchanti punabbhavan\" ti. \"‘Siyā aññena pi' . . . #kathañ ca siyā:# ‘yaṃ kiñci dukkhaṃ sambhoti, sabbaṃ saṅkhārapaccayā' ti ayam ekānupassanā, ‘saṃkhārānan te-eva ",
  "snp3.12:14.1": "",
  "snp3.12:14.2": "",
  "snp3.12:14.3": "",
  "snp3.12:14.4": "asesavirāganirodhā n' atthi dukkhassa sambhavo' ti ayaṃ dutiyānupassanā. ",
  "snp3.12:14.5": "Evaṃ sammā\" . . . ",
  "snp3.12:14.6": "athāparaṃ etad avoca Satthā: 731. ",
  "snp3.12:15.1": "\"Yaṃ kiñci dukkhaṃ sambhoti, ",
  "snp3.12:15.2": "sabbaṃ saṃkhārapaccayā, ",
  "snp3.12:15.3": "saṃkhārānaṃ nirodhena ",
  "snp3.12:15.4": "n' atthi dukkhassa sambhavo. 732. ",
  "snp3.12:16.1": "Etam ādīnavaṃ ñatvā ",
  "snp3.12:16.2": "‘dukkhaṃ saṃkhārapaccayā' ",
  "snp3.12:16.3": "sabbasaṃkhārasamathā ",
  "snp3.12:16.4": "saññāya uparodhanā ",
  "snp3.12:16.5": "evaṃ dukkhakkhayo hoti, -- ",
  "snp3.12:16.6": "etaṃ ñatvā yathātathaṃ 733. ",
  "snp3.12:17.1": "sammaddasā vedaguno ",
  "snp3.12:17.2": "samma-d-aññāya paṇḍitā ",
  "snp3.12:17.3": "abhibhuyya Mārasaṃyogaṃ ",
  "snp3.12:17.4": "nāgacchanti punabbhavan\" ti. ",
  "snp3.12:18.1": "\"‘Siyā aññena pi' . . . ",
  "snp3.12:18.2": "kathañ ca siyā: ",
  "snp3.12:18.3": "‘yaṃ kiñci dukkhaṃ sambhoti, sabbaṃ viññāṇapaccayā' ti ayam ekānupassanā, ",
  "snp3.12:18.4": "‘viññāṇassa tv-eva asesavirāganirodhā n' atthi dukkhassa sambhavo' ti ayaṃ dutiyānupassanā. ",
  "snp3.12:18.5": "Evaṃ sammā\" . . . ",
  "snp3.12:18.6": "athāparaṃ etad avoca Satthā: 734. ",
  "snp3.12:19.1": "\"Yaṃ kiñci dukkhaṃ sambhoti, ",
  "snp3.12:19.2": "sabbaṃ viññāṇapaccayā, ",
  "snp3.12:19.3": "viññāṇassa nirodhena ",
  "snp3.12:19.4": "n' atthi dukkhassa sambhavo. 735. ",
  "snp3.12:20.1": "Etam ādīnavaṃ ñatvā ",
  "snp3.12:20.2": "‘dukkhaṃ viññāṇapaccayā' ",
  "snp3.12:20.3": "viññāṇūpasamā bhikkhu ",
  "snp3.12:20.4": "nicchāto parinibbuto\" ti. ",
  "snp3.12:21.1": "\"‘Siyā aññena pi' . . . ",
  "snp3.12:21.2": "kathañ ca siyā: ",
  "snp3.12:21.3": "‘yaṃ kiñci dukkhaṃ sambhoti, sabbaṃ phassapaccayā' ti ayam ekānupassanā, ",
  "snp3.12:21.4": "‘phassassa tv-eva asesavirāganirodhā n' atthi dukkhassa sambhavo' ti ayaṃ dutiyānupassanā. ",
  "snp3.12:21.5": "Evaṃ sammā\" . . . ",
  "snp3.12:21.6": "athāparaṃ etad avoca Satthā: 736. ",
  "snp3.12:22.1": "\"Tesam phassaparetānaṃ ",
  "snp3.12:22.2": "bhavasotānusārinaṃ ",
  "snp3.12:22.3": "kummaggapaṭipannānaṃ ",
  "snp3.12:22.4": "ārā saṃyojanakkhayo. 737. ",
  "snp3.12:23.1": "Ye ca phassaṃ pariññāya ",
  "snp3.12:23.2": "aññāya upasame ratā, ",
  "snp3.12:23.3": "te ve phassābhisamayā ",
  "snp3.12:23.4": "nicchātā parinibbutā\" ti. ",
  "snp3.12:24.1": "\"‘Siyā aññena pi' . . . ",
  "snp3.12:24.2": "kathañ ca siyā: ",
  "snp3.12:24.3": "‘yaṃ kiñci dukkhaṃ sambhoti, sabbaṃ vedanāpaccayā' ti ayam ekānupassanā, ",
  "snp3.12:24.4": "‘vedanānan tv-eva asesavirāganirodhā n' atthi dukkhassa sambhavo' ti ayaṃ dutiyānupassanā. ",
  "snp3.12:24.5": "Evaṃ sammā\" . . . ",
  "snp3.12:24.6": "athāparaṃ etad avoca Satthā: 738. ",
  "snp3.12:25.1": "\"Sukhaṃ vā yadi vā dukkhaṃ ",
  "snp3.12:25.2": "adukkhamasukhaṃ sahā ",
  "snp3.12:25.3": "ajjhattañ ca bahiddhā ca ",
  "snp3.12:25.4": "yaṃ kiñci atthi veditaṃ, 739. ",
  "snp3.12:26.1": "etaṃ ‘dukkhan' ti ñatvāna ",
  "snp3.12:26.2": "mosadhammaṃ palokinaṃ ",
  "snp3.12:26.3": "phussa phussa vayaṃ passaṃ ",
  "snp3.12:26.4": "evaṃ tattha virajjati, ",
  "snp3.12:26.5": "vedanānaṃ khayā bhikkhu ",
  "snp3.12:26.6": "nicchāto parinibbuto\" ti. ",
  "snp3.12:27.1": "\"‘Siyā aññena pi' . . . ",
  "snp3.12:27.2": "kathañ ca siyā: ",
  "snp3.12:27.3": "‘yaṃ kiñci dukkhaṃ sambhoti, sabbaṃ taṇhāpaccayā' ti ayam ekānupassanā, ",
  "snp3.12:27.4": "‘taṇhāya tv-eva asesavirāganirodhā n' atthi dukkhassa sambhavo' ti ayaṃ dutiyānupassanā. ",
  "snp3.12:27.5": "Evaṃ sammā\" . . . ",
  "snp3.12:27.6": "athāparaṃ etad avoca Satthā: 740. ",
  "snp3.12:28.1": "\"Taṇhādutiyo puriso ",
  "snp3.12:28.2": "dīgham addhāna saṃsaraṃ ",
  "snp3.12:28.3": "itthabhāvaññathābhāvaṃ ",
  "snp3.12:28.4": "saṃsāraṃ nātivattati. 741. ",
  "snp3.12:29.1": "Etam ādīnavaṃ ñatvā ",
  "snp3.12:29.2": "taṇhā dukkhassa sambhavaṃ ",
  "snp3.12:29.3": "vītataṇho anādāno ",
  "snp3.12:29.4": "sato bhikkhu paribbaje\" ti. ",
  "snp3.12:30.1": "\"‘Siyā aññena pi' . . . ",
  "snp3.12:30.2": "kathañ ca siyā: ",
  "snp3.12:30.3": "‘yaṃ kiñci dukkhaṃ sambhoti, sabbaṃ upādānapaccayā' ti ayam ekānupassanā, ",
  "snp3.12:30.4": "‘upādānānan tv-eva asesavirāganirodhā n' atthi dukkhassa sambhavo' ti ayaṃ dutiyānupassanā. ",
  "snp3.12:30.5": "Evaṃ sammā\" . . . ",
  "snp3.12:30.6": "athāparaṃ etad avoca Satthā: 742. ",
  "snp3.12:31.1": "\"Upādānapaccayā bhavo, ",
  "snp3.12:31.2": "bhūto dukkhaṃ nigacchati, ",
  "snp3.12:31.3": "jātassa maraṇam hoti, ",
  "snp3.12:31.4": "eso dukkhassa sambhavo. 743. ",
  "snp3.12:32.1": "Tasmā upādānakkhayā ",
  "snp3.12:32.2": "samma-d-aññāya paṇḍitā ",
  "snp3.12:32.3": "jātikkhayaṃ abhiññāya ",
  "snp3.12:32.4": "nāgacchanti punabbhavan\" ti. ",
  "snp3.12:33.1": "\"‘Siyā aññena pi' . . . ",
  "snp3.12:33.2": "kathañ ca siyā: ",
  "snp3.12:33.3": "‘yaṃ kiñci dukkhaṃ sambhoti, sabbaṃ ārambhapaccayā' ti ayam ekānupassanā, ",
  "snp3.12:33.4": "‘ārambhānan tv-eva asesavirāganirodhā n' atthi dukkhassa sambhavo' ti ayaṃ dutiyānupassanā. ",
  "snp3.12:33.5": "Evaṃ sammā\" . . . ",
  "snp3.12:33.6": "athāparaṃ etad avoca Satthā: 744. ",
  "snp3.12:34.1": "\"yaṃ kiñci dukkhaṃ sambhoti, ",
  "snp3.12:34.2": "sabbaṃ ārambhapaccayā, ",
  "snp3.12:34.3": "ārambhānaṃ nirodhena ",
  "snp3.12:34.4": "n' atthi dukkhassa sambhavo. 745. ",
  "snp3.12:35.1": "Etam ādīnavaṃ ñatvā ",
  "snp3.12:35.2": "‘dukkhaṃ ārambhapaccayā' ",
  "snp3.12:35.3": "sabbārambhaṃ paṭinissajja ",
  "snp3.12:35.4": "anārambhe-vimut- tino 746. ",
  "snp3.12:36.1": "ucchinnabhavataṇhassa ",
  "snp3.12:36.2": "santacittassa bhikkhuno ",
  "snp3.12:36.3": "vitiṇṇo jātisaṃsāro, ",
  "snp3.12:36.4": "n' atthi tassa punabbhavo\" ti. ",
  "snp3.12:37.1": "\"‘Siyā aññena pi' . . . ",
  "snp3.12:37.2": "kathañ ca siyā: ",
  "snp3.12:37.3": "‘yaṃ kiñci dukkhaṃ sambhoti, sabbaṃ āhārapaccayā' ti ayam ekānupassanā, ",
  "snp3.12:37.4": "‘āhārānan tv-eva asesavirāganirodhā n' atthi dukkhassa sambhavo' ti ayaṃ dutiyānupassanā. ",
  "snp3.12:37.5": "Evaṃ sammā\" . . . ",
  "snp3.12:37.6": "athāparaṃ etad avoca Satthā: 747. ",
  "snp3.12:38.1": "\"Yaṃ kiñci dukkhaṃ sambhoti, ",
  "snp3.12:38.2": "sabbaṃ āhārapaccayā, ",
  "snp3.12:38.3": "āhārānaṃ nirodhena ",
  "snp3.12:38.4": "n' atthi dukkhassa sambhavo. 748. ",
  "snp3.12:39.1": "Etam ādīnavaṃ ñatvā ",
  "snp3.12:39.2": "‘dukkhaṃ āhārapaccayā' ",
  "snp3.12:39.3": "sabbāhāraṃ pariññāya ",
  "snp3.12:39.4": "sabbāhāram anissito 749. ",
  "snp3.12:40.1": "ārogyaṃ samma-d-aññāya ",
  "snp3.12:40.2": "āsavānaṃ parikkhayā ",
  "snp3.12:40.3": "saṃkhāya sevī dhammaṭṭho ",
  "snp3.12:40.4": "saṃkhaṃ na upeti vedagū\" ti. ",
  "snp3.12:41.1": "\"‘Siyā aññena pi' . . . ",
  "snp3.12:41.2": "kathañ ca siyā: ",
  "snp3.12:41.3": "‘yaṃ kiñci dukkhaṃ sambhoti, sabbaṃ iñjitapaccayā' ti ayam ekānupassanā, ",
  "snp3.12:41.4": "‘iñjitānan tv-eva asesavirāganirodhā n' atthi dukkhassa sambhavo' ti ayaṃ dutiyānupassanā. ",
  "snp3.12:41.5": "Evaṃ sammā\" . . . ",
  "snp3.12:41.6": "athāparaṃ etad avoca Satthā: 750. ",
  "snp3.12:42.1": "\"Yaṃ kiñci dukkhaṃ sambhoti, ",
  "snp3.12:42.2": "sabbaṃ iñjitapaccayā, ",
  "snp3.12:42.3": "iñjitānaṃ nirodhena ",
  "snp3.12:42.4": "n' atthi dukkhassa sambhavo. 751. ",
  "snp3.12:43.1": "Etam ādīnavaṃ ñatvā ",
  "snp3.12:43.2": "‘dukkhaṃ iñjitapaccayā' ",
  "snp3.12:43.3": "tasmā ejaṃ vossajja ",
  "snp3.12:43.4": "saṃkhāre uparundhiya ",
  "snp3.12:43.5": "anejo anupādāno ",
  "snp3.12:43.6": "sato bhikkhu paribbaje\" ti. ",
  "snp3.12:44.1": "\"‘Siyā aññena pi' . . . ",
  "snp3.12:44.2": "kathañ ca siyā: ",
  "snp3.12:44.3": "‘nissitassa calitaṃ hotī' ti ayam ekānupassanā, ",
  "snp3.12:44.4": "‘anissito na calatī' ti ayaṃ dutiyānupassanā. ",
  "snp3.12:44.5": "Evaṃ sammā\" . . . ",
  "snp3.12:44.6": "athāparaṃ etad avoca Satthā: 752. ",
  "snp3.12:45.1": "\"Anissito na calati, ",
  "snp3.12:45.2": "nissito ca upādiyaṃ ",
  "snp3.12:45.3": "itthabhāvaññathābhāvaṃ ",
  "snp3.12:45.4": "saṃsāraṃ nātivattati. 753. ",
  "snp3.12:46.1": "Etam ādīnavaṃ ñatvā ",
  "snp3.12:46.2": "‘nissayesu mahabbhayaṃ' ",
  "snp3.12:46.3": "anissito anupādāno ",
  "snp3.12:46.4": "sato bhikkhu paribbaje\" ti. ",
  "snp3.12:47.1": "\"‘Siyā aññena pi' . . . ",
  "snp3.12:47.2": "kathañ ca siyā: ",
  "snp3.12:47.3": "‘rūpehi bhikkhave āruppā santatarā' ti ayam ekānupassanā, ",
  "snp3.12:47.4": "‘āruppehi nirodho santataro' ti ayaṃ dutiyānupassanā. ",
  "snp3.12:47.5": "Evaṃ sammā\" . . . ",
  "snp3.12:47.6": "athāparaṃ etad avoca Satthā: 754. ",
  "snp3.12:48.1": "\"Ye ca rūpūpagā sattā ",
  "snp3.12:48.2": "ye ca āruppavāsino ",
  "snp3.12:48.3": "nirodhaṃ appajānantā, ",
  "snp3.12:48.4": "āgantāro punabbhavaṃ. 755. ",
  "snp3.12:49.1": "Ye ca rūpe pariññāya ",
  "snp3.12:49.2": "arūpesu susaṇṭhitā , ",
  "snp3.12:49.3": "nirodhe ye vimuccanti, ",
  "snp3.12:49.4": "te janā maccuhāyino\" ti. ",
  "snp3.12:50.1": "\"‘Siyā aññena pi' . . . ",
  "snp3.12:50.2": "kathañ ca siyā: ",
  "snp3.12:50.3": "yaṃ bhikkhave sadevakassa lokassa samārakassa sabrahmakassa sassamaṇabrāhmaṇiyā pajāya sadevamanussāya ‘idaṃ saccan' ti upanijjhāyitaṃ, tadam ariyānaṃ ‘etaṃ musā' ti yathābhūtaṃ samma-ppaññāya suddiṭṭhaṃ -- ayam ekānupassanā, ",
  "snp3.12:50.4": "yaṃ bhikkhave sadevakassa --pe-- sadevamanussāya ‘idaṃ musā' ti upanijjhāyitaṃ, tadam ariyānaṃ ‘etaṃ saccan' ti yathābhūtaṃ samma-ppaññāya suddiṭṭhaṃ -- ayaṃ dutiyānupassanā. ",
  "snp3.12:50.5": "Evaṃ sammā\" . . . ",
  "snp3.12:50.6": "athāparaṃ etad avoca Satthā: 756. ",
  "snp3.12:51.1": "\"Anattani attamānaṃ ",
  "snp3.12:51.2": "passa lokaṃ sadevakaṃ ",
  "snp3.12:51.3": "niviṭṭhaṃ nāmarūpasmiṃ, ",
  "snp3.12:51.4": "‘idaṃ saccan' ti maññati. 757. ",
  "snp3.12:52.1": "Yena yena hi maññanti, ",
  "snp3.12:52.2": "tato taṃ hoti aññathā, ",
  "snp3.12:52.3": "taṃ hi tassa musā hoti, ",
  "snp3.12:52.4": "mosadhammaṃ hi ittaraṃ. 758. ",
  "snp3.12:53.1": "amosadhammaṃ nibbānaṃ, ",
  "snp3.12:53.2": "tad ariyā saccato vidū, ",
  "snp3.12:53.3": "te ve saccābhisamayā ",
  "snp3.12:53.4": "nicchātā parinibbutā\" ti. ",
  "snp3.12:54.1": "\"‘Siyā aññena pi pariyāyena sammā-dvayatānupassanā ti, iti ce bhikkhave pucchitāro assu, ",
  "snp3.12:54.2": "‘siyā' ti 'ssu vacanīyā, ",
  "snp3.12:54.3": "kathañ ca siyā: ",
  "snp3.12:54.4": "",
  "snp3.12:54.5": "yaṃ bhikkhave sadevakassa --pe-- sadevamanussāya ‘idaṃ sukhan' ti upanijjhāyitaṃ, tadam ariyānaṃ ‘etaṃ dukkhan' ti yathābhūtaṃ samma-ppaññāya suddiṭṭhaṃ -- ayam ekānupassanā, yaṃ bhikkhave sadevakassa . . . sadevamanussāya ‘idaṃ dukkhan' ti upanijjhāyitaṃ, tadam ariyānaṃ ‘etaṃ sukan' ti yathābhūtaṃ samma-ppaññāya suddiṭṭhaṃ -- ayaṃ dutiyānupassanā. ",
  "snp3.12:54.6": "Evaṃ sammā-dvayatānupassino kho bhikkhave bhikkhuno appamattassa ātāpino pahitattassa viharato dvinnaṃ phalānaṃ aññataraṃ phalaṃ pāṭikaṃkhaṃ: ",
  "snp3.12:54.7": "diṭṭhe va dhamme aññā, sati vā upādisese anāgāmitā\" ti. ",
  "snp3.12:54.8": "Idam avoca Bhagavā, ",
  "snp3.12:54.9": "idaṃ vatvā Sugato athāparaṃ etad avoca Satthā: 759. ",
  "snp3.12:55.1": "\"Rūpā saddā rasā gandhā ",
  "snp3.12:55.2": "phassā dhammā ca kevalā ",
  "snp3.12:55.3": "iṭṭhā kantā manāpā ca, ",
  "snp3.12:55.4": "*yāvat' ‘atthī' ti* vuccati, 760. ",
  "snp3.12:56.1": "Sadevakassa lokassa ",
  "snp3.12:56.2": "ete vo sukhasammatā, ",
  "snp3.12:56.3": "yattha c' ete nirujjhanti, ",
  "snp3.12:56.4": "taṃ nesaṃ dukkhasammataṃ. 761. ",
  "snp3.12:57.1": "‘Sukhan' ti diṭṭham ariyehi ",
  "snp3.12:57.2": "sakkāyass' uparodhanaṃ, ",
  "snp3.12:57.3": "#paccanīkam idaṃ hoti# ",
  "snp3.12:57.4": "sabbalokena passantaṃ. 762. ",
  "snp3.12:58.1": "Yaṃ pare sukhato āhu, ",
  "snp3.12:58.2": "tad ariyā āhu dukkhato, ",
  "snp3.12:58.3": "yaṃ pare dukkhato āhu, ",
  "snp3.12:58.4": "tad ariyā sukhato vidū, -- ",
  "snp3.12:59.1": "passa dhammaṃ durājānaṃ, ",
  "snp3.12:59.2": "sampamūḷh' ettha aviddasū. 763. ",
  "snp3.12:59.3": "Nivutānaṃ tamo hoti, ",
  "snp3.12:59.4": "andhakāro apassataṃ, ",
  "snp3.12:60.1": "satañ ca vivaṭaṃ hoti ",
  "snp3.12:60.2": "āloko passatām iva, ",
  "snp3.12:60.3": "santike na vijānanti ",
  "snp3.12:60.4": "magā dhammass' akovidā. 764. ",
  "snp3.12:61.1": "Bhavarāgaparetehi ",
  "snp3.12:61.2": "bhavasotānusārihi ",
  "snp3.12:61.3": "māradheyyānupannehi ",
  "snp3.12:61.4": "nāyaṃ dhammo susambudho. 765. ",
  "snp3.12:62.1": "Ko nu aññatra-m-ariyehi ",
  "snp3.12:62.2": "padaṃ sambuddhum arahati, ",
  "snp3.12:62.3": "yaṃ padaṃ samma-d-aññāya ",
  "snp3.12:62.4": "parinibbanti anāsavā\" ti. ",
  "snp3.12:63.1": "Idam avoca Bhagavā. ",
  "snp3.12:63.2": "Attamanā te bhikkhū Bhagavato bhāsitaṃ abhinanduṃ. Imasmiṃ ",
  "snp3.12:63.3": "kho pana veyyākaraṇasmiṃ bhaññamāne saṭṭhimattānaṃ bhikkhūnaṃ anupādāya āsavehi cittāni vimucciṃsū ti ",
  "snp3.12:63.4": "DVAYATĀNUPASSANĀSUTTAṂ NIṬṬHITAṂ. Tass' uddānaṃ: ",
  "snp3.12:64.0": "",
  "snp3.12:64.1": "Saccaṃ upadhi avijjañ ca ",
  "snp3.12:64.2": "saṃkhārā viññāṇapañcamaṃ, ",
  "snp3.12:64.3": "phassa-vedaniyā taṇhā ",
  "snp3.12:64.4": "upādānārambhā āhārā ",
  "snp3.12:64.5": "iñjite phanditaṃ rūpaṃ ",
  "snp3.12:64.6": "sacca-dukkhena soḷasā ti. ",
  "snp3.12:64.7": "Tass' uddānaṃ: ",
  "snp3.12:65.0": "",
  "snp3.12:65.1": "Pabbajjañ ca Padhānañ ca ",
  "snp3.12:65.2": "Subha . . . Sundari (tathā) ",
  "snp3.12:65.3": "Māghasuttaṃ Sabhiyo ca ",
  "snp3.12:65.4": "selo Sallaṃ pavuccati ",
  "snp3.12:66.1": "Vāseṭṭho cāpi Kokāli ",
  "snp3.12:66.2": "Nālako Dvayatānupassanā, ",
  "snp3.12:66.3": "dvādas' etāni suttāni ",
  "snp3.12:66.4": "Mahāvaggo ti vuccatī ti. 766. "
}
